Aug 24 10:29:03 cobalt24 vmunix: isp1: Not probed.
Aug 24 10:29:03 cobalt24 vmunix: isp in slot 10 not configured.

My first reaction was to assume that our console firmware is too
old to deal with rev G of the QLA1040. I downloaded the most
recent version of the firmware (6.8a) from the Digital's ftp
