From tru64-unix-managers  Wed Aug 19 19:00:32 1998
From: Gary Munroe <GMUNROE () flemingc ! on ! ca>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 1998 19:00:32 +0000
To: tru64-unix-managers
Subject: SUMMARY: Complete Backup solution
