Hello,

Thanks to Thomas Leitner, Wesley Darlington and Mark McCann for the
quick respones.

The question was:

What Network Card to go with OSF 3.2.

Answer:

Cards with Digital 21140 Chip (DE500 Card from Digital) are well
supported by DU 4.0. For DE500-AA and OSF 3.2 you need patch OSF375-048
or Digital Unix V3.2G patchkit duv32gas00004-19980219. I think the
patches should work with every card equipped with the 21140 Chip. I will
try this soon...

