X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=tru64-unix-managers&m=96078718211727

Many thanks to William Flett and Neil Dyce for their replies.  It seems my
problem was twofold.  I had neglected to check "DECWindows" compatibility
in the config options, and my .xsession file was not compatible with
Digital's xdm.  Apparently, the xsession requires the line "mwm || xlogo"
at the end of the xsession file, otherwise it just executes the file and
exits.  
It appears to be working now.

Thanks, 

Jon


