Dear Managers,

     Next week I'm upgrading my 3000/600 with two 1GB drives running
v4.0B to a 4GB system disk (/,/usr, and swap) and a 9GB user disk
(/usr/local and /usr/users) running 4.0D.  All filesystems are AdvFS.
